---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Professional Experience | Manuel Jiménez"
  description="Professional experience in digital process modernization, automation, web platforms, CMS, technical documentation and technology support."
  lang="en"
>
  <article class="experience-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE</p>

      <h1>Professional Experience</h1>

      <p class="intro">
        Experience in digital process modernization, automation, web platform
        improvement, content management, technical documentation and technology
        support.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="experience-list">
      <section class="experience-item">
        <header class="experience-header">
          <div class="experience-heading">
            <h2>IT Systems Operations Technician</h2>
            <p class="company">UNED Madrid</p>
          </div>

          <p class="duration">≈ 1 year</p>
        </header>

        <div class="experience-content">
          <p class="experience-summary">
            Contributed to the digital modernization of internal processes
            through automation and technology platform improvement, as well as
            technical documentation, technology evaluation and support for
            internal systems and platforms.
          </p>

          <div class="experience-area">
            <h3>Process Automation</h3>

            <ul>
              <li>
                Automation of administrative processes through workflows built
                with Microsoft Power Automate.
              </li>
              <li>
                Reduction of manual intervention in repetitive tasks and
                improvement of operational efficiency.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="experience-area">
            <h3>Web Platforms &amp; CMS</h3>

            <ul>
              <li>
                Migration and redesign of the institutional portal and intranet
                from WordPress to Magnolia CMS.
              </li>
              <li>
                Page layout, configuration and customization of the environment
                using the available Magnolia CMS tools.
              </li>
              <li>Development and improvement of internal web platforms.</li>
              <li>
                Participation in the technical SEO optimization of the
                institutional portal.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="experience-area">
            <h3>Technical Documentation</h3>

            <ul>
              <li>
                Preparation of technical documentation for systems and digitized
                processes.
              </li>
              <li>
                Preparation of user manuals to support the use of systems and
                processes.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="experience-area">
            <h3>Technology Evaluation</h3>

            <ul>
              <li>
                Evaluation of hardware and software solutions aimed at
                optimizing internal processes.
              </li>
              <li>
                Assessment of technology alternatives to support the evolution
                of the organization's systems.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="experience-area">
            <h3>Technology Support</h3>

            <ul>
              <li>
                Technical support and incident resolution for internal systems
                and platforms.
              </li>
              <li>
                Follow-up of technical issues to help maintain the operation of
                systems used by the organization.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="experience-area">
            <h3>Technologies &amp; Tools</h3>

            <p class="technology-list">
              Microsoft Power Automate · Magnolia CMS · WordPress · HTML · CSS ·
              Technical SEO · Microsoft Word
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="experience-item">
        <header class="experience-header">
          <div class="experience-heading">
            <h2>Web Application Developer</h2>
            <p class="company">ESMASA (Internship)</p>
          </div>

          <p class="duration">3 months</p>
        </header>

        <div class="experience-content">
          <p class="experience-summary">
            Contributed to the development of a web application focused on
            document digitization and management.
          </p>

          <div class="experience-area">
            <h3>Web Development &amp; Document Management</h3>

            <ul>
              <li>Development of web application functionality.</li>
              <li>
                Work with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap, jQuery and
                DataTables.
              </li>
              <li>Development with PHP and work with MySQL databases.</li>
              <li>Use of Google Apps Script.</li>
              <li>
                Development of functionality related to document upload and
                management.
              </li>
              <li>
                Work with the local environment and configuration required by
                the application.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="experience-area">
            <h3>Technologies &amp; Tools</h3>

            <p class="technology-list">
              HTML · CSS · JavaScript · Bootstrap · jQuery · DataTables · PHP ·
              MySQL · Google Apps Script
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .experience-page {
    width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--content-width));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: 4rem 6rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 750px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .experience-list {
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .experience-item {
    padding-block: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .experience-item:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .experience-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .experience-heading {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .experience-header h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .company,
  .duration {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .duration {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  .experience-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .experience-summary {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .experience-area + .experience-area {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .experience-content h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .experience-content ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .experience-content li + li {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
  }

  .technology-list {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .experience-page {
      padding-block: 3rem 5rem;
    }

    .page-header {
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .experience-header {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .experience-item {
      padding-block: 3rem;
    }
  }
</style>
